# DeepSeek (OpenAI-compatible chat completions).
# Required for AI paste-recipe / ingredient-resolve / meal-plan draft.
# Never commit a real key. Without a key those paths fall back to local rules.
#
# Local / dev: copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill the key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
# Vite / TanStack Start loads `.env.local` on the server only.
#
# Cursor Cloud Agents: add DEEPSEEK_API_KEY yourself in the environment
# dashboard (do not put a real key in the repo).
#
# Cloudflare Workers: set DEEPSEEK_API_KEY as a Worker secret / project env
# (dashboard or `wrangler secret put`). Do not put the key in wrangler.jsonc.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Better Auth session signing key. Local dev can use `.dev.vars` or this file.
# Production: Workers → Settings → Runtime variables and secrets → Secret.
# Do not put it in wrangler.jsonc or in a build variable.
# Generate one with: openssl rand -base64 32
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
# Optional public origin if it cannot be inferred from the request:
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://your-worker.example.com

# Optional overrides
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat
